# kega-fusion
===
Kega Fusion is an emulator for a number of different Sega 8 and 16-bit consoles.

- Emulates the Sega SG-1000, SC-3000, Master System, and Game Gear

- Emulates the Sega MegaDrive/Genesis and its accessories the Sega Mega-CD/Sega-CD and the Sega 32X

- Emulates the Sega Pico

This is an unofficial community AppImage packaging, not affiliated with or endorsed by Steve Snake or Carpe Ludum.
